message: "If you use chat2archive, please cite it as below."
title: "chat2archive"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MartinuzziFrancesco/chat2archive"
abstract: >
  chat2archive converts AI chat conversations (ChatGPT, Claude, and generic
  transcripts) into AIR (AI Interaction Record): a provider-neutral,
  RO-Crate-based archival package suitable for deposit on Zenodo.
keywords:
  - AI interaction record
  - RO-Crate
  - research data management
  - provenance
  - Zenodo
